  "body": "Per https://w3c.github.io/webappsec/specs/mixedcontent/#websockets-integration, the preferred behavior for mixed content web sockets is not to throw a SecurityError during construction, but instead block the connection, just like with other network APIs.\n\nFixes https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=28841.\n\n@mikewest, saw this lonely bug over there and thought I'd fix it for ya.\n",
